Package: resmon
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: xfce4-panel (>= 4.18)
Description: Resource Monitor applet for the Xfce panel
 Merges the CPU/memory/swap/uptime monitors of xfce4-systemload-plugin
 with a full netload-style network monitor: two bars (download/upload),
 adaptive Auto_Max scale, byte/bit rates, manual / default-route /
 sum-of-all traffic sources, configurable layout (below/above/left/right)
 and spacing.
